This game is always a blast to play with friends. We don't play it very well, we tend to die often to many things (darkness, monsters, insanity,
), but we have so much fun we can't even be annoyed by it all.
I have so many fond memories of this game as it developed and grew, and every time new changes were made, my friends and I were ready and willing to jump back in and die to the new developments, laughing every step of the way.

