A little disappointed....I bought this on sale, so yea it was only 50 cents..but I could have saved myself the money. Had I known I cant play the game....
the previews make the game adorable and fun..but you need NVIDIA PhysX to run it and EVEN if you follow instructions...you cant play the damned game..because it says: {"Unable to find PhysX libraries. The PhysX are not installed correctly."}
So basically, until this issue is either fixed or the dev puts instructions on how to fix it in the discription. I do not recommend purchusing this.
